OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1970FEdward II airs on BBC Two. 1969
OL,7,FEdinburgh Festival production from the
OL,8,FProspect Theatre Company and reworked
OL,9,Ffor the BBC. Recorded at Piccadilly
OL,10,FTheatre. Features first same-sex kiss
OL,11,Fon British television between Ian
OL,12,FMcKellan (Edward) and James Laurenson
OL,13,F(Piers Gaveston).
OL,14,
OL,15,CG1979FThe first edition of Kick Start
OL,16,Fairs on BBC One.
OL,17,
OL,18,CG1982FThe final episode of Jane airs
OL,19,Fon BBC Two.
